WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.340 --> 00:00:05.840
It is an incredible view that we have
here being able to look at the screen and

00:00:05.840 --> 00:00:07.910
see all of the faces of
people around the world.

00:00:07.910 --> 00:00:11.711
And it's inspiring that you could
run an event like this online.

00:00:11.711 --> 00:00:21.711
[MUSIC]

00:00:23.849 --> 00:00:25.620
&gt;&gt; What a great group.

00:00:25.620 --> 00:00:28.600
Thank you so much for all participating.

00:00:28.600 --> 00:00:34.500
I just want to say that you have actually
transformed my view of virtual education.

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:37.800
&gt;&gt; Man, I mean,
it has been an experience for

00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:41.550
the years that it's totally memorable and
unforgettable.

00:00:41.550 --> 00:00:45.505
&gt;&gt; You can do anything that's truly
authentic to you, and your strengths and

00:00:45.505 --> 00:00:48.541
your interests and passions and
it will serve the world.

00:00:48.541 --> 00:00:51.452
[MUSIC]

00:00:51.452 --> 00:00:53.630
&gt;&gt; Okay, let's give a cheers to Naomi.

00:00:53.630 --> 00:00:55.130
&gt;&gt; Thank you so much.

00:00:55.130 --> 00:00:58.561
I'm speechless and
I'm just crying [LAUGH].

00:00:58.561 --> 00:01:02.391
&gt;&gt; The revelation was that
you could actually form

00:01:02.391 --> 00:01:06.540
