more than the sum of the parts.

00:01:14.450 --> 00:01:16.500
&gt;&gt; Community is such a special one and

00:01:16.500 --> 00:01:18.900
I know that a lot of you
feel this way as well.

00:01:18.900 --> 00:01:21.230
&gt;&gt; Thanks to all of you and cheers.

00:01:21.230 --> 00:01:26.283
